<title>USA: Indications S. Korea buys 35,000 T U.S. soybeans.</title>
<headline>Indications S. Korea buys 35,000 T U.S. soybeans.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indications are South Korea bought 35,000 tonnes of U.S. soybeans early Thursday for June shipment, export sources said.</p>
<p>Other exporters could not confirm the deal.</p>
<p>No other details were available.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
